---
// The site's mark: p50, p90 and p99 as bars. The p99 bar is amber, the palette's colour for a
// cost. src/assets/favicon.svg draws the same bars in fixed colours on a dark tile, because a tab
// icon cannot read the page's palette.
---

<svg class="mark" viewBox="4 4 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
  <rect x="6" y="20" width="4" height="6" />
  <rect x="14" y="16" width="4" height="10" />
  <rect class="tail" x="22" y="6" width="4" height="20" />
</svg>
